$ nexoctl admin user list mem

$ nexoctl admin user add mem alice alice-secret --policy readwrite
Added user "alice" (enabled).

$ nexoctl admin user add mem bob bob-secret-1 --policy readonly,diagnostics
Added user "bob" (enabled).

$ nexoctl admin user add mem carol carol-secret --disabled
Added user "carol" (disabled).

$ nexoctl admin user add mem alice alice-secret
! nexoctl: error: add user "alice": user already exists: "alice" (user_already_exists)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl admin user add mem dave dave-secret --policy missing
! nexoctl: error: add user "dave": policy not found: "missing" (policy_not_found)
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin user list mem
ACCESS KEY               STATUS    POLICIES                       GROUPS
alice                    enabled   readwrite                      -
bob                      enabled   diagnostics,readonly           -
carol                    disabled  -                              -

$ nexoctl admin user info mem alice
Access Key: alice
Status: enabled
Policies: readwrite
Groups: -
Created: 2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC
Updated: 2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC

$ nexoctl admin user disable mem alice bob
User "alice" is disabled.
User "bob" is disabled.

$ nexoctl admin user enable mem alice
User "alice" is enabled.

$ nexoctl admin user info mem ghost
! nexoctl: error: user "ghost": user not found: "ghost" (user_not_found)
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin group add mem devs alice bob --policy writeonly
Created group "devs" with 2 member(s).

$ nexoctl admin group add mem devs carol
Updated group "devs": 3 member(s), policies writeonly.

$ nexoctl admin group add mem devs
! nexoctl: error: group "devs" exists: name the members to add (or --policy)
! Run 'nexoctl admin group add --help' for usage.
[exit 2]

$ nexoctl admin group add mem ops
Created group "ops" with 0 member(s).

$ nexoctl admin group list mem
GROUP                    STATUS    MEMBERS  POLICIES
devs                     enabled         3  writeonly
ops                      enabled         0  -

$ nexoctl admin group info mem devs
Group: devs
Status: enabled
Policies: writeonly
Members: alice,bob,carol
Created: 2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC
Updated: 2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC

$ nexoctl admin group members mem devs
alice
bob
carol

$ nexoctl admin group members mem ops
Group "ops" has no members.

$ nexoctl admin user policy mem alice
User alice: readwrite
Group devs: writeonly
Effective: readwrite,writeonly

$ nexoctl admin group disable mem devs
Group "devs" is disabled.

$ nexoctl admin user policy mem alice
User alice: readwrite
Group devs: writeonly (disabled, not applied)
Effective: readwrite

$ nexoctl admin group enable mem devs
Group "devs" is enabled.

$ nexoctl admin group remove mem devs carol
Removed 1 member(s) from group "devs".

$ nexoctl admin group remove mem ops
Removed group "ops".

$ nexoctl admin group info mem ops
! nexoctl: error: group "ops": group not found: "ops" (group_not_found)
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin user remove mem carol ghost
Removed user "carol".
! nexoctl: error: remove user "ghost": user not found: "ghost" (user_not_found)
[exit 3]

